{"name":"11-4-1E","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG-Sewer","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Alarm","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The time is 23:40. In the sewers under a certain alley in Belgrade."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"W-What was that?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hostiles?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No...sensors aren't registering any individuals, but the reflection surface has enlarged all of a sudden..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Reflection? Enlarged? Explain it in a way that I understand!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hush... That didn't sound like enemy reinforcements... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Hold on... The controls of the floodgates B2, G5, and K9 suddenly require higher clearance to operate?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Danger","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO, look under our feet! Water! Water's coming in!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Water?! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The floodgate that's stopping the current has been opened! They're trying to drown us!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Drown us?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Have you forgotten?! Our bodies are only equipped with the most rudimentary waterproof casings. If water manages to seep in, we'll definitely short out!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh... Can we make it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We can't possibly stay ahead of how quickly the water level is rising... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I see it! A platform just ahead! Can you jump up there, SOP-II?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No problem! Hah!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"CG11-1","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"SOP-II and RO jump onto the platform."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We can probably last a little longer here... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Just a second, I'm trying to regain access to the floodgate controls... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Dammit, access denied! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I knew it was fishy – overriding their protocols was too easy! We've been lured into a trap!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD II","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Can't you override it again?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It was so easy the first time only because they wanted us to fall for it. Now they've fired up their defenses... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"On top of that, they've also refreshed the clearance codes of the other floodgate controls. If I don't put a stop to that— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"SOP-II, keep me on my feet! This might take some time, but I need to force my way through on Level II. Don't let me fall into the water!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD II","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gotcha! I'll hug you tight!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks. Commander, you still there?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Commander","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The firewalls found our trojan. I'm searching for a new entry route. ","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you, Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's just as you said – it IS a trap... But we simply cannot give up such an important lead."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I will try to retake control over the floodgates in Level II, but they might directly cut off external connections. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Considering the fact that they're operating off-site, I doubt they'd do that...and we can only hope I'm right... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"To break through their defenses faster, please allow me to harness the computational capacity of more T-Dolls! Let's get started!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"CG11-2","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sure, let's go! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Uh...don't you have to close your eyes...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They've actually gone and cut off external connections...! So they have no intention of controlling the gates anymore?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What?! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then we really are done for!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No...don't panic yet... There's still a way..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you sure?! The water is almost up to my thighs!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It-It's going to be fine, SOP-II! D-D-Don't freak out! Maybe you're just too short!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What?! How could you ever say that to me?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Mk46","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG-Sewer","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Mk46","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO, you still there?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're here! Are you alright?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Mk46","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mk46","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're perfectly fine, but from what we can see, water is running through two of the floodgates. I'm guessing the enemies are trying to drown you?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, duh!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Mk46","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mk46","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, alright, I know.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Our reinforcements have arrived and the Commander has also located the enemies' command center. We're getting ready to clear them all out in one go.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then you'd better hurry, or I'll have to stay out of the water by sitting on RO's head!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"White","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
